meta {
  name: Request Dispute
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/escrow/dispute
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "order_id": "{{orderId}}",
    "reason": "The seller did not deliver the work as agreed upon in the contract."
  }
}

docs {
  ## Request Dispute

  Seller requests a dispute on a DELIVERED order. Atomically sets order + escrow to REVIEW.

  ### Request Body
  | Field    | Type   | Required | Description                                     |
  |----------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------|
  | order_id | string | ✅       | Order UUID                                      |
  | reason   | string | ✅       | Min. 10 characters, max. 1000 characters        |

  ### Headers
  | Header        | Value               | Required |
  |---------------|---------------------|----------|
  | Authorization | Bearer {{authToken}}| ✅       |

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Dispute requested successfully. Admin will review shortly.",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **400** — Invalid input / Order not in DELIVERED status
  - **401** — Missing/invalid token
  - **403** — Only seller can dispute
}
